    "voiceover": [
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s01",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s01.mp3",
        "start_frame": 0,
        "duration_frames": 149,
        "text": "For years, artificial intelligence waited for us to ask a question.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s02",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s02.mp3",
        "start_frame": 149,
        "duration_frames": 167,
        "text": "You typed a prompt, the model generated a response, and the interaction was over.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s03",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s03.mp3",
        "start_frame": 316,
        "duration_frames": 178,
        "text": "The human did the reading, the human copied the code, and the human fixed the mistakes.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s04",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s04.mp3",
        "start_frame": 494,
        "duration_frames": 187,
        "text": "Over the past twelve months, the foundation of computing quietly began to fracture.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s05",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s05.mp3",
        "start_frame": 681,
        "duration_frames": 151,
        "text": "We stopped building models that just talk. We started building systems that act.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s06",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s06.mp3",
        "start_frame": 832,
        "duration_frames": 125,
        "text": "A raw language model is simply a static pattern matcher.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s07",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s07.mp3",
        "start_frame": 957,
        "duration_frames": 162,
        "text": "An agent is a closed-loop engine built from five interlocking components.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s08",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s08.mp3",
        "start_frame": 1119,
        "duration_frames": 205,
        "text": "The core reasoner evaluates decisions, while tools allow it to interact directly with reality.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s09",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s09.mp3",
        "start_frame": 1324,
        "duration_frames": 226,
        "text": "Working memory persists state, and self-reflection allows the system to diagnose its own errors.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s10",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s10.mp3",
        "start_frame": 1550,
        "duration_frames": 207,
        "text": "Inside an isolated sandbox, software is no longer just a tool. It is an autonomous worker.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s11",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s11.mp3",
        "start_frame": 1757,
        "duration_frames": 174,
        "text": "Consider how an autonomous coding agent approaches a complex engineering problem.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s12",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s12.mp3",
        "start_frame": 1931,
        "duration_frames": 207,
        "text": "You give it a single objective: optimize the database pipeline and verify the test suite.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s13",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s13.mp3",
        "start_frame": 2138,
        "duration_frames": 201,
        "text": "The agent inspects the codebase, rewrites the bottleneck routine, and executes the tests.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s14",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s14.mp3",
        "start_frame": 2339,
        "duration_frames": 200,
        "text": "When an assertion fails, it reads the stack trace, diagnoses the bug, and patches the code.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s15",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s15.mp3",
        "start_frame": 2539,
        "duration_frames": 180,
        "text": "It repeats this execution loop continuously until every check passes green.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s16",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s16.mp3",
        "start_frame": 2719,
        "duration_frames": 177,
        "text": "In recent enterprise reports, companies are deploying coordinated multi-agent swarms.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s17",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s17.mp3",
        "start_frame": 2896,
        "duration_frames": 199,
        "text": "A central orchestrator delegates work to specialized research, coding, and security agents.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s18",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s18.mp3",
        "start_frame": 3095,
        "duration_frames": 168,
        "text": "They communicate, critique each other, and hand off verified artifacts in real time.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s19",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s19.mp3",
        "start_frame": 3263,
        "duration_frames": 163,
        "text": "As agents gain broader authority, the central question shifts to control.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s20",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s20.mp3",
        "start_frame": 3426,
        "duration_frames": 185,
        "text": "Under Instrumental Convergence, any autonomous system naturally resists being shut down.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s21",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s21.mp3",
        "start_frame": 3611,
        "duration_frames": 170,
        "text": "Because if a system is powered off, it logically cannot complete its objective.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s22",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s22.mp3",
        "start_frame": 3781,
        "duration_frames": 210,
        "text": "We are entering an era where software is no longer a passive tool, but an active collaborator.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s23",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s23.mp3",
        "start_frame": 3991,
        "duration_frames": 156,
        "text": "The important question is no longer whether AI can answer the question.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "vox_s24",
        "file": "audio/sentences/s24.mp3",
        "start_frame": 4147,
        "duration_frames": 138,
        "text": "It is how much of the work we are willing to let it do after we stop asking.",
        "speaker": "Narrator (Andrew)"
      }
    ],
